# ─── Zoho Books OAuth Credentials ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Restored from worklog history (user's own credentials, originally supplied
# by the user during the Zoho Books integration setup). These are required for
# decrypting stored OAuth tokens (AES-256-GCM key derived from ZOHO_CLIENT_SECRET)
# and for all Zoho Books REST API calls. Without these, the sync engine fails
# with "Zoho Books is not connected" even though tokens exist in the DB.
